# ============================================================
# Adaptive ML-DST V6 — Git Attributes
# ============================================================
# This repository publishes SHA-256 integrity hashes of its source
# files (reports/final/manifests/source_hashes.json). To keep those
# hashes valid on every platform, Git performs NO line-ending
# normalisation here: files are stored and checked out byte-for-byte
# as committed. Do not add `text=auto` or `eol=` rules.

* -text

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicitly binary artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
*.joblib binary
*.pkl   binary
*.db    binary
